.claude/

# Generated test corpus (regenerate with docs/fixtures/generate_test_corpus.py).
# Excluded because it contains zip bombs (~1 MB each) and the EICAR string that some
# scanners flag. The generator + runner + MANIFEST are committed.
docs/test-corpus/clean/
docs/test-corpus/adversarial/

# Viewer-validation corpus binaries. `originals/` holds LIVE malicious payloads
# (DDE field codes, PDF JavaScript) and must never reach the public repo; the
# sanitised outputs are large (~21 MB of fixture padding) and regenerable. The
# generators + CHECKLIST.md are committed — run build_corpus.py to rebuild.
docs/viewer-validation/originals/
docs/viewer-validation/sanitised/

# Local-only AI-agent instruction files — kept for reference, never published.
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
GEMINI.md

# Local-only dev extras carried over from the private repo — never published.
scripts/make-public.sh
docs/test-corpus/
docs/superpowers/
docs/progress.md
